                <pb facs="0523" n="407" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg407"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 365.117/30.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>14. Your 30, September 21. Have pressed matter repeatedly without receiving other
                    reply than verbal promise to investigate. See my despatch 247, September 15.
                    Many cases great hardship.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
